git-svn-id: https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/hadoop/common/trunk@1376929 13f79535-47bb-0310-9956-ffa450edef68

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the condition in the `UserGroupInformation.getLoginUser()` method that required both the presence of a token file location and the security being enabled. This restriction prevented the MapReduce functionality from working correctly when security features were turned off, leading to failures in user authentication and token management in non-secure environments.

